Type: Package
Package: SurfaceMesh
Title: 3D Surface Meshes Based on 'CGAL'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    c(person("Daniel", "Wollschlaeger",
             role=c("aut", "cre"),
             email="wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de"),
      person("Stephane", "Laurent", role=c("aut")))
Maintainer: Daniel Wollschlaeger <wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de>
Description: Basic processing of 3D surface meshes based on the
    'C++' library 'CGAL' (<https://www.cgal.org/>).
    Reads and writes common file formats for meshes and
    polygon soups.
    Supports mesh repair, remeshing (isotropic, smooth, simplify),
    subdivision, Boolean operations on bounded volumes, surface
    reconstruction, (optimal) bounding box, convex hull,
    surface distance metrics (such as Hausdorff),
    and volume-overlap similarity measures (such as 'JSC', 'DSC').
    Adapts code from packages 'Boov', 'PolygonSoup',
    and 'cgalMeshes' developed by Stephane Laurent.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/dwoll/SurfaceMesh/
BugReports: https://github.com/dwoll/SurfaceMesh/issues/
